      "fingerprint from a 403's headers: 'shopify'  (seller hint: 'brand_owned')\n",
      "bot-walled shopify PDP -> shopping · pdp · brand_owned · signals=['url', 'platform', 'model']\n",
      "off-topic shopify homepage -> unrelated (relevant=False)\n"
     ]
